### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@accessToken = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refreshToken = YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE
@courseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@assignmentId = YOUR_ASSIGNMENT_ID_HERE
@submissionId = YOUR_SUBMISSION_ID_HERE
@quizId = YOUR_QUIZ_ID_HERE
@attemptId = YOUR_ATTEMPT_ID_HERE

### ============================================================
### AUTHENTICATION & PROFILE
### ============================================================

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Sign Up (Create Student Account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Log In
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Get Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Update Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Johnny",
  "bio": "Software Engineering Student"
}

### 6. Refresh Access Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 7. Log Out (Revoke Refresh Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### ============================================================
### DEVELOPER 3: ASSIGNMENTS & SUBMISSIONS MODULE
### ============================================================

### 8. Create Assignment (Teacher or Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Assignment 1: Algorithms & Data Structures",
  "description": "Implement a binary search tree and test edge cases.",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59.000Z",
  "maxScore": 100
}

### 9. Get Assignments by Course (Enrolled Student, Teacher, or Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/course/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Get Assignment Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Update Assignment (Teacher who owns course or Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Assignment 1: Advanced Data Structures",
  "maxScore": 120
}

### 12. Submit Assignment (Enrolled Student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Here is my solution code and implementation notes for the assignment.",
  "fileUrl": "https://example.com/files/my-solution.zip"
}

### 13. Get My Submission (Student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/submissions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. List All Submissions for Assignment (Teacher or Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. Grade Submission (Teacher or Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/submissions/{{submissionId}}/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 95,
  "feedback": "Excellent work! Well documented and clean code."
}

### 16. Delete Assignment (Teacher or Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ============================================================
### DEVELOPER 3: QUIZZES & AUTOMATED GRADING ENGINE
### ============================================================

### 17. Create Quiz (Teacher or Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Quiz 1: Data Structures Fundamentals",
  "description": "Test your knowledge on Stacks, Queues, and Binary Search Trees.",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "timeLimit": 30
}

### 18. Add Question: Single Choice (Teacher or Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/{{quizId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionText": "What is the average time complexity of searching in a Balanced Binary Search Tree?",
  "questionType": "SINGLE_CHOICE",
  "points": 2,
  "options": [
    { "optionText": "O(1)", "isCorrect": false },
    { "optionText": "O(log n)", "isCorrect": true },
    { "optionText": "O(n)", "isCorrect": false },
    { "optionText": "O(n^2)", "isCorrect": false }
  ]
}

### 19. Add Question: True/False (Teacher or Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/{{quizId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionText": "A queue follows the Last-In-First-Out (LIFO) order.",
  "questionType": "TRUE_FALSE",
  "points": 1,
  "options": [
    { "optionText": "True", "isCorrect": false },
    { "optionText": "False", "isCorrect": true }
  ]
}

### 20. Add Question: Short Answer (Teacher or Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/{{quizId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionText": "Which data structure operates on a First-In-First-Out (FIFO) principle?",
  "questionType": "SHORT_ANSWER",
  "points": 2,
  "options": [
    { "optionText": "queue", "isCorrect": true }
  ]
}

### 21. Get Quizzes by Course (Student, Teacher, or Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/course/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 22. Get Quiz Details & Questions (Student View hides answers, Teacher View shows isCorrect)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/{{quizId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 23. Start Quiz Attempt (Enrolled Student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/{{quizId}}/attempts/start
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 24. Submit Quiz Attempt & Run Automated Grading Engine (Student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/attempts/{{attemptId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": "QUESTION_1_ID",
      "selectedOptionId": "OPTION_ID_HERE"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "QUESTION_2_ID",
      "selectedOptionId": "OPTION_ID_HERE"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "QUESTION_3_ID",
      "answerText": "queue"
    }
  ]
}

### 25. Get Student's Past Attempts & Scores (Student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/{{quizId}}/attempts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 26. List All Student Attempts for a Quiz (Teacher or Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quizzes/{{quizId}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

